<p>To the fullest extent the law allows, products are provided "as is" as set out in sections 13 to 15 of the <a href="/terms/">Terms of Sale and Use</a>. If a product is defective, undelivered or not as described, see the <a href="/refunds/">Refund Policy</a>.</p>
